    'M4.5 6h15A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 21 7.5v9a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-15A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 16.5v-9A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 6Z',
